    "created_at": "2022-05-11T18:29:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-11T18:29:30Z",
    "body": "I interpret the comment is about \"Set the element's [parser document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#parser-document) to the [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#document)\", not the non-blocking flag.\r\n\r\nThe non-blocking flag seems to make dynamically inserted `<script>` just after creation async, even though it doesn't have `async` content attribute.\r\n\r\nIt might be easier to understand if we rewrite Step 28 of prepare-a-script like:\r\n\r\n- If ([the script's type](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#concept-script-type) is \"classic\" and the element has a [src](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#attr-script-src) attribute), or [the script's type](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#concept-script-type) is \"module\":\r\n    - If the element has an [async](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#attr-script-async) attribute, or the element has the [\"non-blocking\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#non-blocking) flag set:\r\n        - => async (`set of scripts that will execute as soon as possible`)\r\n    - Else if the element is not [\"parser-inserted\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#parser-inserted):\r\n        -  => in order (`list of scripts that will execute in order as soon as possible`)\r\n    - Else if the element has a [defer](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#attr-script-defer) attribute, or [the script's type](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#concept-script-type) is \"module\":\r\n        - => defer (`list of scripts that will execute when the document has finished parsing`)\r\n    - Else:\r\n        - => parser-blocking ([pending parsing-blocking script](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#pending-parsing-blocking-script))\r\n- Else:\r\n    - If the element is [\"parser-inserted\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#parser-inserted), and either the parser that ...\r\n        - => parser-blocking\r\n    - Else:\r\n        - => Immediate evaluation\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1aw4zIJKgqtmeja5poJCG1jLBM5H7PyWlgrgk8iEiayM/edit#slide=id.g8621aafc1b_0_73\r\n",
